{"repositoryId":668960488,"availability":"available","full":"DAMO-NLP-MT/PolyLM","name":"PolyLM","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":77,"forks":7,"created":"2023-07-21T02:42:13Z","updated":"2023-08-11T11:31:48Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://modelscope.cn/studios/damo/demo-polylm-multialpaca-13b/summary","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:24:36.490Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T13:24:36.490Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T13:24:36.490Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T13:24:36.490Z","stars":77,"forks":7}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["PolyLM-1.7B ｜ PolyLM-13B ｜ PolyLM-13B-Chat ｜ Demo ｜ &nbspPaper","PolyLM is a polyglot large language model, which is aimed to address the following blanks and limitations in current LLM research, offering a comprehensive and innovative solution to advance this field.","We opensource PolyLM on both Modelscope and Huggingface involving two scales (i.e., 1.7B and 13B)."],"features":["Covering 18 of the most commonly spoken languages. PolyLM is proficient in the major non-English languages spoken worldwide, such as Spanish, Russian, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Thai, Indonesian, and Chinese etc. It is a…","Better multingual instruction-following capability. We propose MULTIALPACA to complement ALPACA and CHINESEALPACA, making LLMs better follow multilingual instructions, particularly those coming from non-native English…","Strong performance. In comparison with popular multilingual LLMs of the similar model size, PolyLM demonstrates remarkable performance on various tasks, including QA, understanding, and generation."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DAMO-NLP-MT/PolyLM/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7146211cdef7a5d96c356d30391975803dd450f1773fc69cf0eb65f700c59ba6","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T13:24:36.672Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:24:36.672Z","projectInsights":